# Canonical line endings for pinned/byte-pinned artifacts and SQL so their SHA-256 digests are
# reproducible on any platform and any checkout (`core.autocrlf` cannot silently convert these).
# WP2.3+ pins hashes against these LF blobs; MUST NOT be removed without a re-lock.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
